<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Used in no coins </Major>
    <Description>jump to the right and goes back up really fast. often used in no coin challenges or trying to dodge obstacles.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 79 1
Delay 2 ms
KeyDown 81 1
Delay 52 ms
KeyUp 79 1
Delay 7 ms
KeyUp 81 1
Delay 108 ms
KeyDown 80 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyDown 82 1
Delay 21 ms
KeyUp 82 1
Delay 21 ms
